    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "Overview",
      "content": {
        "json": "# Azure VM Disk SKU Limits (free platform metrics)\n\nThrottling diagnosis for **Azure VMs** built entirely on free, built-in Azure Monitor platform metrics and Azure Resource Graph \u2014 no VM Insights, no Log Analytics ingestion, no agent. Start at the **Throttling diagnosis** band to tell at a glance whether throttling is coming from a single disk SKU limit or the VM SKU aggregate, then drill into the trend charts and provisioned-limit reference.\n\nArc-enabled servers and guest filesystem/capacity views are intentionally omitted here to keep this workbook cost-free; use the full VM Disk Observability workbook for those."
      }
    },
